OL,3,GNEWSARescue dog saves new owner's life
OL,4,Aafter collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn adopted Shetland sheepdog has been
OL,7,Fcredited with saving her owner's life
OL,8,Fafter she alerted a woman that he
OL,9,Fneeded help after collapsing in a
OL,10,Fditch.
OL,12,FDuchess, a 12-year-old Sheltie, was out
OL,13,Fwalking with her owner, Clive Taylor,
OL,14,Fin Brenchley, last week when he lost
OL,15,Fconsciousness and fell face-first into
OL,16,Fa roadside ditch.
OL,18,FClive, 82, had been slowly building up
OL,19,Fhis strength, after having a pacemaker
OL,20,Ffitted, when he collapsed.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
